	<!-- Ram-mounted lord battle templates (issue #515). Verbatim clones of
	     erebor_bat_template_medium_a..e plus the two mount slots, so each lord keeps the exact
	     gear he already wore and only gains a war ram. Used ONLY by the three tier-3 frontier
	     clans (Bit Gror / Bit Rori / Bit Norin = lord_E4_*, lord_E6_*, lord_E7_*). The medium_*
	     originals stay untouched because all seven lord groups share them, so editing one would
	     have mounted every dwarf lord in the kingdom. Dain keeps his own dain_bat_equipment and
	     stays on foot by decision. Heavy barding, not elite: elite is left as headroom.
